WEBVTT

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.580
Reo.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.080
Maina.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:38.620
Thanks.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:44.700
Reo, are you okay coming to
practice so early every day?

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.790
Is your body okay?

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:48.870
And you're here every morning with me.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.290
I'm...

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.580
...here because I'm not good enough yet.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.750
That's not true.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.870
But I understand how you feel.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:00.080
It's hard to feel confident,
no matter how many lessons you have.

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.500
--You feel that way, too?
--Yup.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.660
In my old group, too.
I wanted to be the center for so long

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.500
that I kept frantically practicing.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.660
I wanted to practice more than anyone else.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:13.700
But...

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:25.870
There are just people you can't beat.

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:28.950
Hard work doesn't always pay off.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:30.750
I know that.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:35.200
But working hard is all that I can do.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.790
That's not true, Reo! You're--

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:37.950
Morning!

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.330
"Teramoto"
Jeez, you guys are here early!

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:40.950
--Morning.
--Morning.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:42.950
--Morning.
--Morning!

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:44.080
Morning!

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:47.870
Okay!

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:50.410
The festival's coming up! Let's keep it up!

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:52.540
Yeah! Okay, girls.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:54.830
Let's do our best!

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:56.200
Yeah!

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:36.370
"16th Setouchi Idol Festival"

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.290
"If My Favorite Pop Idol Made It to the Budokan"

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.790
I'm so nervous!

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:46.910
Will we be able to get a spot
where we'll be able to see them?

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.330
They're on earlier than I thought.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:50.830
Yeah.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.830
Oh, I guess Maple's the final act.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:53.910
It appears so.

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.950
Well, the final act is always
the most popular group.

00:03:56.950 --> 00:04:00.620
Wait, does that mean if you're
not popular, you're on sooner?

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.370
--No, no, no!
--Not exactly!

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:05.160
They're on just a smidge before the middle.

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:06.370
They're in a weird spot.

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:07.910
Gloom...

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.290
"Staff Only"

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.700
Whoa! It's the staff entrance!

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:13.660
Let's go in!

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.160
Yay!

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.080
Staff bathrooms!

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:20.120
We're idols, so we won't use them, but yay!

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.620
The staff hallway!

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:26.160
Hey, look!
There's catering! You can see the steam!

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:29.580
You're right.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.160
They're called hot meals.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.120
Smells so good...

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.040
You're making it obvious that we're
not used to this, so stop.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.040
Come on, you two. Let's go.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.410
Okay.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:46.120
Wow! So many idols!

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.040
Just remember, we're idols, too.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.040
"Stellights"
I wonder where our greenroom is!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.700
"Maple Doll"
I wonder where our greenroom is!

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:56.290
Oh, it looks like we're in this one.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:59.250
Okay... Open the door!

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:02.580
So tiny.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.790
Seven of us in this room?

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:07.000
Don't worry, look!

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.250
We actually brought a pot today.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.620
But we're not eating udon today.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:15.830
Hey, do you mind if I go brush my teeth?

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.540
Wait. I'll go, too.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:21.040
If you go out and take a right,
there'll be a washbasin.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.830
How do you know that?

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:26.000
Oh, yeah. I guess this isn't
your first time here, Reo.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.870
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.910
And you guys were the final act before.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:33.040
Yeah...

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.830
Sorry! I didn't mean it in a bad way!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:40.830
"12th Setouchi Idol Festival"
Are you nervous, Reo?

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:43.450
"12th Setouchi Idol Festival"
Y-Yeah...

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.330
At a festival this small?

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:50.750
You'll never make it to the Budokan that way.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:57.450
"Merch B" "Merch A"

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.120
Thank you very much!

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.410
You sure went all out, Eripiyo.

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:06.120
I want to enjoy Maina's first festival
appearance to the fullest!

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:07.910
I gave up on the past,

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:11.750
but I'm never going to miss a first again!

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.160
I see your point...

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:15.870
I'm going to buy another copy!

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.120
What about you, Mr. Kumasa?

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:21.660
I'm just going with my one. It's just...

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:24.040
"Handshake Ticket" "Reo"
Today's a very special day.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.370
I want to enjoy it as much as I can.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:33.830
Oh, god, they fell!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:37.040
--Please don't do anything
to make me say, "I told you so."
--I guess I'll just keep it at one, too.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:39.700
"11:00 Show begins"

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.700
I-It's almost time!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.040
We're two acts away.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.620
I'm getting a little nervous...

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:19.790
We'll be fine.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:30.290
Let's go, ChamJam!

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:31.870
Oh, Reo.

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:44.330
It's been a while.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.500
Wait, you're already up?

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.700
That's pretty early.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.330
Yeah...

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.870
Are you nervous?

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.160
I am.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:56.120
I guess it's been a while since
you've been to a venue this big.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:01.200
Yeah. But as long as I have fun with everyone,
that's all that I could ask for.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.200
Yeah!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.790
Yeah! I hope you have fun!

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:23.160
My group and I are going
to perform at the Budokan.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:29.790
Huh?

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.660
Do your best out there.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.540
Reo!

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.870
Sorry...

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:53.290
I guess I need to get a grip.

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:55.700
I'm the center, after all.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:59.330
I'm sorry, everyone...

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.000
You don't need to apologize!

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:06.040
I always wondered if you should
be in a group like Cham!

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:09.290
That's how amazing I think you are!

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:13.620
All this time... Even now!

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:16.750
I love you, Reo-<i>chin</i>!

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:20.000
You probably don't know this,
but there's so much emanating

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.660
from your back when you work hard
as the center, Reo-<i>chin</i>!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.500
What's emanating?

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.660
Love!

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.660
I think about it all the time!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:33.410
That the center of ChamJam
is made from a bunch of love!

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:42.200
Reo.

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.830
Hard work...

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:50.080
You said there's no guarantee
that hard work always pays off...

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:54.700
But... I don't think it all
goes to waste, either!

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.620
Maina...

00:09:56.620 --> 00:10:01.000
If even one percent of 100 pays off,

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:05.080
then let's make that one percent
into 100 percent on stage!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:10.250
Because I believe you can do that, Reo!

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:16.330
Thank you, everyone...

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:23.080
I'm... so happy that I got
to come here with all of you.

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:35.580
I'm okay now. I won't stop again.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.330
No matter what!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.660
Because all of us...

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.450
Because all of us are going to the Budokan!

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:11.370
Let's go.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:49.870
Maina!

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.370
Maina!

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:09.160
Eripiyo!

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:28.330
♪ I can hear it ♪

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:34.000
♪ It's filled with so many emotions ♪

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:40.450
♪ Our song doesn't even have a name yet ♪

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:46.330
♪ But your hand immediately led the way ♪

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:51.910
♪ After we run through the storm ♪

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:59.080
♪ What will we see on the other side? ♪

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:08.660
Everyone's here with me... But that's not all!

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:10.950
I'm right here!

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:13.700
I'm so happy that I'm...

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:16.950
I'm so happy that I'm an idol!

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:23.080
♪ The promised land that's so far away ♪

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:29.160
♪ Believe that we'll get there someday ♪

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:35.290
♪ Though we can't see this
stage of dreams right now ♪

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:45.120
♪ I'm sure that it continues on forever ♪

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.950
Thank you so much!

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:53.080
We're ChamJam!

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.830
Bye bye!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.450
--Maki!
--Yuka!

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:01.160
--Reo!
--Maina!

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.580
I know I keep saying this, but...

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:23.160
Just keep saying it!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.540
That was so awesome!

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.250
Yeah!

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:29.120
Cham's performance was so...
amazingly... awesome!

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:32.790
I can't believe I got to see Sorane
dance on such a big stage.

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:35.620
I guess Sorane was great, too,
though I wasn't watching her much.

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:39.370
Well, there's still some time
before Cham's merch line.

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:41.080
How should we kill some time?

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.830
Let's have another bowl of udon!

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:44.410
--Celebratory udon!
--Thanks!

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.910
Why are you making it sound like
we're having celebratory wine?

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:50.790
Wh-What's all that about?

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:53.500
Looks like Maple's performance
is about to start.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:55.580
"Maple Doll"

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.580
Hey, guys! Did you wait long?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.750
We're Maple Doll!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.910
Whoa! They're getting hyped over there!

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:08.040
Well, they are the final act.

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:13.870
Let's all have fun till the very end!

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:17.450
Wow...

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:20.370
Well, we performed on the same stage, too.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.290
And we kicked butt, too!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:27.450
Did you see how far the Cham fans
were in the crowd?

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:29.080
Yeah.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:31.870
You can tell by how they were waving
around their King Blades.

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:35.910
We still have a long way to go.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:40.950
But we definitely took a step forward!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.580
Girls, did you fix your makeup?

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:48.500
We're gonna go hand out fliers.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:51.250
Don't waste any time until
the special fan event!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:52.910
We're going to promote Cham to the last second

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:55.750
and have as many people remember
you guys as possible!

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:57.790
Whoa! Mr. Yoshikawa actually seems determined!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:58.700
He's actually acting like the president!

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:00.290
Don't say stuff like that right now.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.580
Where's your answer?

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:02.700
Right!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.540
We're ChamJam.
We're having a merch booth after this!

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:19.450
Um, please come see us.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.080
Thank you very much!

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:28.870
Eripiyo's watching Maple's performance?!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:31.750
Wh-Which girl?
Which girl does she have her eyes on?!

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:33.870
What's wrong, Maina?

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:34.830
Oh, it's nothing!

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:35.910
Could I get a flier?

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.450
S-Sure.

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:41.290
Here you go. If you can,
please come to our merch booth.

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:42.540
Uh, sure.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.950
That girl was super cute.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.410
What? You changing favorites?
Don't blame me if they find out.

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:50.370
They'll never find out
if you don't say anything!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.750
Sorane.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:58.910
I wonder how many people here love
one of the girls that perform on stage the most.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:01.120
If someone tells me that they love me the most,

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:04.290
I just think, "Wow, I see. That makes me happy."

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:09.660
But looking at their blog,
they never wrote a single thing about me.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:13.660
We just basically have to believe
what we're told.

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:19.290
I really hope that they continue
to like me the most.

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:23.830
You just have to always
show off your cutest self.

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:25.290
If they happen to think,

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:28.620
"Wow, she's cuter than last time.
I like her even more now,"

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:30.660
You'll always be number one to them, Maina.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.330
Huh...

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.660
I guess there're a lot of
different kinds of idols.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:42.830
Yes, there are. There are a lot of idols.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.620
But even though there are so many idols,

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:48.620
the fact that I got to meet the one and only Reo

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:51.870
is the most precious treasure
that my life could ever give me.

00:17:56.450 --> 00:18:03.250
Even watching all these different idols,
all I can think of is Maina.

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:08.500
There are so many...
but Maina's the only one in my world.

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:14.540
It's not just that she's number one...
Maina's the only one.

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.500
Motoi, what did you think
of our performance today?

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:30.830
I was just reminded how much I like you, Sorane.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:34.330
Also, I was thankful that you're an idol.

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:35.160
Huh?

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:37.450
If you weren't an idol,

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:41.450
I don't think I could've
told you that I like you.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:42.950
So, uh...

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:46.080
Thank you for letting me say that I like you.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.040
W-Wait, what?!

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:50.950
You say that you like me, but what number am I?

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:54.410
Y-You're my number one, duh!

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:57.500
I'm going to take your word on that, Motoi.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.620
"Merch B" "Merch A"
Great job today, Reo.

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:03.830
I was only paying attention to Cham... and you.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:07.580
I know that. I've known that all this time.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:11.540
I wasn't nervous at all because
you were here, Kumasa.

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:13.660
I danced okay, right?

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:14.660
Yeah.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:19.040
Maina's line is wide open!

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:21.410
--You, there! How about saying hi to Maina?
--I'm gonna go ahead.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:22.910
S-Sure.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:26.000
What should I tell her?

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:28.750
Maina, you were super cute again today.

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:29.750
Thanks!

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:33.870
I want to give her some
special words for this special day.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:37.330
Um, ever since I became your fan,

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:42.370
I've gotten to experience so many firsts
with my brother, Mr. Kumasa, and Eripiyo.

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:46.040
But telling her to keep doing her best
makes me sound cocky...

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:51.950
I'm having so much fun.
I'm so thankful that I got to meet you, Maina.

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:54.000
Something that I can only tell her today...

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.080
Something I can only tell her today...

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.700
Anyone else for Maina?

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:59.750
I'm going to cut off the line
if no one else shows up!

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:00.790
Maina, right here!

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:07.790
Er... Nice weather we're having...

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:09.700
Eripiyo...

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:12.910
I was really happy to see you up front.

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:19.700
"Merch D"
Did you... have fun?

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.620
Of course I did!

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.250
I had so much fun and I was so happy!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:33.580
You worked so hard up there!
You were so cute and wonderful!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.370
I'm glad we both got to be here today,

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:40.330
but I hope I get to go to
the Budokan with you someday.

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:44.870
No, not "I hope I get to go." I'm going!

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:46.950
I have to do my best so that happens!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.700
What in the world is this creature?!
She's too cute!

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:54.580
Nothing in the world can top her cuteness!

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.620
Is this because she managed to make it through

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.290
such a big hurdle like this festival?

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:02.290
So if she goes to the Budokan
or aims even higher...

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:04.950
Just how invincible is she going to get?!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.870
Eripiyo.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.250
Because of you, Eripiyo, I...

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:14.500
I... I was able to do my best!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:16.200
Thank you so much!

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:20.500
I'll love you forever.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:21.500
Huh?

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:23.910
The Budokan...

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:24.830
Yes?

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:29.160
If you made it to the Budokan, I could die.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.080
Huh?

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:33.870
Maina, if you made it to the Budokan,
I would die!

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:35.120
Huh?

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:12.620
We finally made it.

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:13.950
This is...

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:15.660
...the Budokan!

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:18.540
It's huge! It's the Budokan
as far as the eye can see!

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.660
So that must be the golden onion.

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:24.370
We were so excited from the festival
that we went all the way to Tokyo, but...

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:26.250
I'm glad we came.

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:29.040
So Cham is going to stand
on the stage here someday.

00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:32.910
This is the Budokan...?

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:36.410
This seems different from what we imagined...

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:37.660
Are you sure we've got the right place?

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:39.410
Th-This is the Budokan!

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:40.750
"X Tokyo Budokan (Adachi Ward)"

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:42.750
"O Nippon Budokan (Chiyoda Ward)"

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:46.200
Didn't the Budokan have an onion on top?

00:23:46.200 --> 00:23:49.580
I mean, this sorta looks like an onion, too!
Minced onions!

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:51.160
You're right!

00:23:51.160 --> 00:23:53.830
Let's stand on the stage here someday.

00:23:53.830 --> 00:23:55.500
Yeah.

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:56.790
I'm gonna do my best!

00:23:56.790 --> 00:24:00.290
Sorry, everyone. I guess this
is the wrong place after all.

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:01.290
"If My Favorite Pop Idol Went
to the Budokan, I Would Die"
What?!

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:04.950
"If My Favorite Pop Idol Went
to the Budokan, I Would Die"
"The End"
